    "updated_at": "2023-12-19T18:06:44Z",
    "body": "This might work for keys that would otherwise be handled by the browser (so the ones in your example would all work, I think), but it's not sufficient for system keys like Alt+Tab. These have to be intercepted (or not) at the OS level, and at least on some OSes (Windows and X11 Linux for sure) this needs to be synchronous, so you can't defer the decision to the web page.",
    "author_association": "NONE",
