    "created_at": "2025-08-20T17:54:53Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-08-20T17:54:53Z",
    "body": "I don't think so. A quick test suggests that `navigator.keyboard` is not defined on Safari. I haven't investigated in detail though.\n\nIt's also worth noting that even Chromium browsers don't support the full spec. Intercepting system keyboard shortcuts such as Cmd+Tab requires accessibility permissions that we didn't want the browser to have, so it's only possible to \"lock\" browser shortcuts such as Cmd+T.",
